### …and its retrieval — eq. (78)

$$
\boldsymbol{y}_t \;=\; \mathcal{M}_t\,\boldsymbol{q}_t
$$

The read. Everything after this equation is about making the *inputs* to this read
adaptive rather than fixed.

--- code
