### …generating its own values (restated in the DGD block) — eq. (87)

$$
\hat{\boldsymbol{v}}_{\square,t} \;=\; \mathcal{M}_{\square,t-1}\big(\boldsymbol{v}_t\big)
$$

Repeated inside the final formulation so the update in eq. 88 is unambiguous about what
its target is.

--- code
