### …with the same 2-layer memory architecture — eq. (91)

$$
\mathcal{M}_{\square}(\cdot) \;=\; (\cdot) \;+\; W_{\square,1}\,\sigma\big(W_{\square,2}(\cdot)\big)
$$

Restated for the chunk-wise form: nothing about the architecture changes, only *when*
each state is read. The chunked update admits the fast dual form of TTT/Titans.

