--- note
### Hope — self-generated values — eq. (95)

$$
\hat{\boldsymbol{v}}_{\square,t} \;=\; \mathcal{M}_{\square,t-1}\big(\boldsymbol{v}_t\big)
$$

The self-modification clause inside Hope. Table 6's ablations of the inner projections
show how much each one matters: removing the in-context `k` costs 1.53 ppl, `v` costs 1.66, while `q`
(already non-adaptive in the final design) is neutral — which is *why* `q` stays frozen.

