PASS  five self-modifying memories + the CMS chain, as the paper specifies   | 5 memories, 3 CMS levels, 53762 params
PASS  the diagram is traced from the module, so it cannot drift from the code   | learning/assets/nested-learning/xai_hope_graph.png
```

